#!/bin/sh
# mdev daemon + module coldplug. Replaces Buildroot's S10mdev: the coldplug
# (modprobe of every modalias: sound, dwc2, brcmfmac, ...) runs in the
# background so it never delays the launcher.
DAEMON="mdev"
PIDFILE="/var/run/$DAEMON.pid"
case "$1" in
start)
	start-stop-daemon -S -b -m -p $PIDFILE -x /sbin/mdev -- -df
	(
		find /sys/ -name modalias -print0 | xargs -0 sort -u | tr '\n' '\0' | \
			xargs -0 modprobe -abq
		/usr/sbin/zpod-bootmark coldplug-done
	) </dev/null >/dev/null 2>&1 &
	;;
stop) start-stop-daemon -K -p $PIDFILE ;;
restart) "$0" stop; "$0" start ;;
esac
exit 0
